ThetoArray()method returns an array containing all of the items in the list.

If no argument is passed then the type of the returned array will beObject. If an array is passed as an argument then this method will return an array with the same data type.

If the array in the argument is large enough to contain all of the list items then this method will return the argument itself after writing the list items into it.

